        "answer": {
          "short": "120 times",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{gold or silver})&=0.05+0.15\\\\P(\\text{gold or silver})&=0.2\\\\f&=np\\\\f&=600\\times0.2\\\\f&=120\\end{align*}$$Expected frequency: 120 times.",
